!!! The call form every other language in the family uses.
!!!
!!! Matrix has no parenthesised call: a variant carries its payload with
!!! 'holding' and a paragraph takes its arguments with 'with'. Left alone this
!!! surfaced far from the mistake as "expected a statement, found '('", which
!!! names neither the call nor a spelling that works.
book diagnostic.parenthesised-call

Outcome begin choice
    when Ready holding number
    when Failed holding text
end choice

main returns number begin paragraph
    value done is Outcome.Ready(1)
    give 0
end paragraph
